{"id":"vod_md_6524","vodId":"6524","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"药屋少女的呢喃","name_cn":"药屋少女的呢喃","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231105-1/10b4b0689482aca72eb8aac9bb083569.jpg"},"summary":"位于大陆中央的一个大国。那个国家皇帝的妃子们住的后宫中有一个少女，名字叫猫猫。之前在花街当药师，目前在后宫工作中。某日，她听闻皇帝的孩子们很短命的传言，现在的两个儿子都因病而日渐虚弱，出于兴趣猫猫开始调查这件事的原因，就像是在说不可能有这样的诅咒。美型的宦官——壬氏，安排猫猫去做皇帝宠妃的试毒者。虽然对人类没有兴趣，但出于对毒与药异常的执著，在花街长大的药师就这样被卷进了各种流言和事件。美丽的蔷薇长着刺，女人的花园里到处是毒，总是少不了的流言与阴谋。尽管麻烦，猫猫还是处理着壬氏不断地推给她的各种工作。难得一见的爱毒少女今天也在后宫里跑来跑去。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,古装"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-03-25 01:15:34","episodeCount":24,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/Fprrj2M4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/JmkpoQUk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/p6XEQ7qt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/AN6ObuvF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231105/qJ7CfiTA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231112/m7fiJaX7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231119/bcMW3JKF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231126/ONA3sqau/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231203/pRlIfmzm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231210/iCEUXgGy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231217/oRiDg76o/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231224/VtnjROrF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240107/LgOEdPOp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240114/xUJCjTNw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240121/B89r5TCQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://p